---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Lineage & Transmission | Padma Pura Foundation"
	description="The Nyingma tradition and the transmission lineages and practice cycles held by Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche, taught through Padma Pura Foundation."
>
	<section class="lineage-opening" aria-labelledby="lineage-heading">
		<p class="lineage-opening__label">Lineage</p>
		<h1 id="lineage-heading">Lineage &amp; Transmission</h1>
		<p class="lineage-opening__intro">
			Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche teaches within the Nyingma tradition of Tibetan Buddhism. He holds and transmits several transmission lineages and practice cycles within that tradition.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="nyingma" aria-labelledby="nyingma-heading">
		<h2 id="nyingma-heading">The Nyingma tradition</h2>
		<div class="nyingma__prose">
			<p>Nyingma is the oldest of the major traditions of Tibetan Buddhism. Over many centuries, its teachings and practices have been preserved and transmitted through numerous lineages and practice cycles.</p>
			<p>The Nyingma tradition includes both long-established transmission lineages and terma traditions — revealed teachings and practice cycles that form an important part of its heritage.</p>
		</div>
	</section>



	<section class="rinpoche-transmission" aria-labelledby="rinpoche-transmission-heading">
		<h2 id="rinpoche-transmission-heading">Rinpoche's training and transmission</h2>
		<div class="rinpoche-transmission__prose">
			<p>Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche received teachings, empowerments, oral transmissions and practice instructions from masters including Kyabjé Dudjom Rinpoche, Dilgo Khyentse Rinpoche, Chadral Rinpoche and Khetsun Sangpo Rinpoche.</p>
			<p>He holds and transmits multiple transmission lineages and practice cycles within the Nyingma tradition. In 1999, Khetsun Sangpo Rinpoche enthroned him as a lineage holder and entrusted him with spiritual authority at Shedup Kunsang Chöling.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="dudjom-tersar" aria-labelledby="dudjom-tersar-heading">
		<h2 id="dudjom-tersar-heading">Dudjom Tersar</h2>
		<div class="dudjom-tersar__prose">
			<p>Dudjom Tersar is a terma tradition within the Nyingma school of Tibetan Buddhism, associated with Dudjom Lingpa and Dudjom Rinpoche, Jigdral Yeshe Dorje. It is not a separate school, but a body of teachings and practice cycles transmitted within the wider Nyingma tradition.</p>
			<p>Dudjom Tersar has a central place in many of the practices, empowerments, oral transmissions and teachings that Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche gives through Padma Pura Foundation activities.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="yangti-nagpo" aria-labelledby="yangti-nagpo-heading">
		<h2 id="yangti-nagpo-heading">Yangti Nagpo and Longchen Nyingthig</h2>
		<div class="yangti-nagpo__prose">
			<p>Rinpoche also holds transmission lineages of Yangti Nagpo, a Dzogchen terma cycle within the Nyingma tradition, and Longchen Nyingthig, the terma tradition revealed by Jigme Lingpa.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="living-transmission" aria-labelledby="living-transmission-heading">
		<h2 id="living-transmission-heading">Living transmission</h2>
		<div class="living-transmission__prose">
			<p>Through his Dharma activity, Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche continues to transmit the teachings and practice cycles he has received and practised, through teachings, empowerments, oral transmissions and practice guidance.</p>
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation supports this activity in the Netherlands, helping create the practical conditions for Rinpoche's visits and for students to receive his guidance and practise together.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.lineage-opening {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-block: clamp(var(--space-8), 9vw, 9rem) clamp(var(--space-9), 10vw, 10rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.lineage-opening__label {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.lineage-opening h1 {
		max-width: 16ch;
		margin: var(--space-6) 0 0 clamp(2rem, 10vw, 8rem);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.5vw, 5.5rem);
		font-weight: 380;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		line-height: 1.02;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.lineage-opening__intro {
		max-width: 26rem;
		margin: clamp(var(--space-5), 3vw, var(--space-7)) 0 0 auto;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.nyingma {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr);
		gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 7vw, 8rem);
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7.5vw, 7rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.nyingma h2,
	.nyingma p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.nyingma h2 {
		padding-top: var(--space-2);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.nyingma__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.nyingma p {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.nyingma p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.rinpoche-transmission {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
		gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 7vw, 8rem);
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-8), 8vw, 7.5rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.rinpoche-transmission h2,
	.rinpoche-transmission p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.rinpoche-transmission h2 {
		padding-top: var(--space-2);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.rinpoche-transmission__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.rinpoche-transmission p {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.rinpoche-transmission p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.dudjom-tersar {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7.5vw, 7rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.dudjom-tersar h2 {
		max-width: 20ch;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-8) clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
		font-weight: 380;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.dudjom-tersar__prose {
		max-width: 44rem;
		margin-left: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
	}

	.dudjom-tersar__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.dudjom-tersar__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.dudjom-tersar__note {
		max-width: 44rem;
		margin: var(--space-7) 0 0 clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.yangti-nagpo {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7.5vw, 7rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.yangti-nagpo h2 {
		max-width: 20ch;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-8) clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
		font-weight: 380;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.yangti-nagpo__prose {
		max-width: 44rem;
		margin-left: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
	}

	.yangti-nagpo__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.yangti-nagpo__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.living-transmission {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 6vw, var(--space-8));
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.living-transmission h2 {
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-7);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.living-transmission__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.living-transmission__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.living-transmission__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	@media (max-width: 48rem) {
		.lineage-opening {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-9);
		}

		.lineage-opening h1 {
			max-width: none;
			margin: var(--space-5) 0 0;
			font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 11vw, 3.5rem);
			line-height: 1.05;
		}

		.lineage-opening__intro {
			max-width: none;
			margin: var(--space-6) 0 0;
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.nyingma {
			display: block;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.nyingma h2 {
			padding: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.nyingma p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.rinpoche-transmission {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.rinpoche-transmission h2 {
			order: -1;
			padding: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.rinpoche-transmission p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.dudjom-tersar {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.dudjom-tersar h2 {
			max-width: none;
			margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
			font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 9vw, 2.75rem);
		}

		.dudjom-tersar__prose {
			max-width: none;
			margin-left: 0;
		}

		.dudjom-tersar__prose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.dudjom-tersar__note {
			max-width: none;
			margin: var(--space-6) 0 0;
		}

		.yangti-nagpo {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.yangti-nagpo h2 {
			max-width: none;
			margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
			font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 9vw, 2.75rem);
		}

		.yangti-nagpo__prose {
			max-width: none;
			margin-left: 0;
		}

		.yangti-nagpo__prose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.living-transmission {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-7);
		}

		.living-transmission h2 {
			padding: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.living-transmission__prose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}
	}
</style>
